## Success Criteria

The UI is successful if:

- A first-time user understands the app flow quickly.
- The demo can be explained smoothly.
- Screens feel visually consistent.
- Important actions are obvious.
- Results are clear but not over-promising.
- Accessibility basics are covered.
- Styling is centralized through reusable tokens/components.